WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.650
In 449 Yazdegerd II
of Sasanian Persia

2
00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:09.372
commanded the Armenians
to renounce Christianity.

3
00:00:09.412 --> 00:00:12.102
In 450 much of Armenia rose,

4
00:00:12.142 --> 00:00:14.544
led by Vardan Mamikonian.

5
00:00:14.784 --> 00:00:18.877
In 451 the armies met
on the plain of Avarayr.

6
00:00:18.917 --> 00:00:21.875
Vardan fell there,
and the field was lost.

7
00:00:22.115 --> 00:00:23.445
Yet the faith held:

8
00:00:23.485 --> 00:00:27.429
in 484 his nephew Vahan
won freedom of worship.

9
00:00:27.669 --> 00:00:30.188
Stand where Vardan stood.

